OL,3,GNEWSATourist killed in wildfire was
OL,4,Atrapped in villa
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British holidaymaker died after a
OL,7,Frampant wildfire trapped her inside the
OL,8,FSpanish villa she was renting, a
OL,9,Fcoroner said.
OL,11,FLisa Fryett, 47, was badly burnt while
OL,12,Fflames surrounded her and partner Simon
OL,13,FBatchelor for up to six hours on 9
OL,14,FJuly, an inquest opening in Chelmsford
OL,15,Fheard.
OL,17,FThe couple, from Canvey Island in
OL,18,FEssex, were rescued from the
OL,19,Fmountainside in Bedar and taken to
OL,20,Fhospital in Seville, but Fryett died
OL,21,Falmost three weeks later.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
